{
  "document_id": "legacy/story/15b3c967fb2b/ch00_meadow",
  "extensions": {
    "legacy": {
      "chapter": 0,
      "location": "羅特帝亞郊外草地。索爾邀亞雷斯比劍被婉拒,兩人發現昏倒的悠妮與在旁戒備的機兵蓋亞;悠妮失憶,只記得自己來自遙遠的馬拉大陸,索爾決意送她回鄉,亞雷斯一度反對後同意同行。",
      "source_dat": "FDTXT_032",
      "title": "序章 — 草地小憩與悠妮、蓋亞加入"
    }
  },
  "kind": "story",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "比劍邀約"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/0/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "亞雷斯,趕快再來比一場!昨天輸給你,我越想越不甘心!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/0/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "贏了就是贏了,何況你已經打贏我十幾場,讓我一場有什麼關係!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/0/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "這可不一樣!我老爸說過,劍技要不斷磨練才會進步.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/0/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "拜託,今天休息吧!風和日麗的日子,躺在草地上曬曬太陽,不是也很愜意?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/0/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "好吧,既然如此,我回去找侍衛們練習也可以!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/0"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "發現悠妮與蓋亞"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "咦,那是什麼東西?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "怎麼了?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "好像是人昏倒在地呢!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "是啊,旁邊那個大傢伙又是什麼?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 30,
              "speaker_name": "蓋亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-30",
          "text": "不要再接近!否則我將照規定採取防衛行動!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "搞什麼嘛!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 9,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-9",
          "text": "嗯,好痛...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "是女孩子呢!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "我去看看!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "小.小姐,你沒事吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 9,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-9",
          "text": "你..你是誰?這裡是哪裡?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/11",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "這裡是羅特帝亞,我叫索爾,請問小姐你的芳名?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 9,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/12",
          "speaker": "character/native-9",
          "text": "我叫..我叫..悠妮吧。我怎麼會來到這裡的?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/13",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "悠妮?好名字。悠妮小姐,妳怎麼會記不得怎麼來到這裡的?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 9,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/14",
          "speaker": "character/native-9",
          "text": "..真的想不起來了,只記得..只記得我好像是從很遠很遠的地方來的。蓋亞?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 30,
              "speaker_name": "蓋亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/15",
          "speaker": "character/native-30",
          "text": "是的,主人。有何吩咐?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 9,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/16",
          "speaker": "character/native-9",
          "text": "我們..是從哪裡來的?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 30,
              "speaker_name": "蓋亞"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/17",
          "speaker": "character/native-30",
          "text": "據我的慣性導航系統顯示,是在那個方位。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/18",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "啊!我知道了,你們是從馬拉大陸來的,我聽老爸說過,那的確是個很遙遠的地方。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/19",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "悠妮小姐,妳是從那個馬..馬拉大陸來的嗎?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 9,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/20",
          "speaker": "character/native-9",
          "text": "我記不得了,只記得..好可怕的惡夢..好可怕..不!不要!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/21",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "悠..悠妮小姐!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 9,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/22",
          "speaker": "character/native-9",
          "text": "我好怕..帶我回家..帶我回家,好嗎?求求你.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/23",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "..好!好!別怕,有我在..放心,我一定帶妳回家!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1/lines/24",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "哎喲喂!這小子該不會想要.."
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/1"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "決定啟程"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/2/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "喂!你真的要去?你瘋了!聽說那裡是與羅特帝亞完全不一樣的地方,為了一個女孩子去冒這種險,未免.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/2/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "我一定要去!亞雷斯,你知不知道怎麼去?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/2/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "這?好..好吧,我回去問問老爹,我想他應該會知道..."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/2/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "好極了,我們整理一些輕便行李,我再向父王稟告一下,就可以出發了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/2/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "我也去好了!誰叫我們是從小打架打到大的朋友?總不能就這樣讓你一個人到馬拉大陸去!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/2/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "亞雷斯,謝謝你!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/2/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "不用謝了,你先帶悠妮小姐回去休養吧!陛下那邊和借船的事我來辦就好了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/2/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "悠妮小姐,妳就先和我回去吧!幾天後我們就啟程回馬拉大陸,妳放心,我一定平安的送妳回家。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 9,
              "speaker_name": "悠妮"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/2/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-9",
          "text": "謝..謝謝你。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/2/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "嘿,我們這就走吧!還有不少事要忙呢!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/15b3c967fb2b/scenes/2"
    }
